-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopInaccessibleCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardopInaccessibleCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopInaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopInaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the strongly inaccessible convention; the clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> excludes the regular strong-limit cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>All three constituent cardinal predicates are called at their unary source signatures; the lower bound is a separate nontriviality guard.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e81c8573f40b6c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Reg}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e81c8573f40b6c7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-strong